<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I was seeking the world and it’s things,</l><l>I was wealthy and yet could not see</l><l>It was Christ I desired,</l><l>Of the world I was tired,</l><l>He loved me and came to my house!</l><l>Jesus loves me and saves all my house!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I was happy with friends, all my mates,</l><l>With my music, wild parties and dates;</l><l>Yet when Christ came to call,</l><l>I have gladly left all!</l><l>He loved me and He gave His all!</l><l>Jesus loves me, I answer His call!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
